Following your tip (thanks to @romainfrancois), I managed to make this work. Instead of testing the existence of the PDF file, I test the existence of a token, because the former approach has two problems:

1. I'll have to delete or move the existing PDF file in advance;
2. The PDF file might happen to be incomplete (`writeBin()` hasn't finished writing it).
